# Harley, Mage Genius

> Harley was a fringe pick for years: flashy burst combo, but any competent tank could stand in front of the carry and eat Deadly Magic for them. The November 2025 patch changed the math. The ring of fire now passes through other heroes, which retires the single most-taught counterplay against him and quietly puts the Mage Genius back on the pick-off map.

## Snapshot

- Role: Assassin, Mage
- Lane: Jungle, Mid
- Specialty: Burst, Poke
- Difficulty: Medium
- Tier this patch: C
- Win rate: 47.65%
- Pick rate: 0.77%
- Ban rate: 3.38%
