## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Pickoff Default (Jungle)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Genius Wand, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Winter Crown
- Core: Genius Wand, Starlium Scythe, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when chain crowd control is stopping Harley from returning to the hat after the ring combo.; Glowing Wand over Divine Glaive when Use when healing or shields keep the marked carry alive and the enemy has not bought heavy Magic Defense.; Blood Wings over Winter Crown when Use when your roamer can cover the exit and a shielded chase gives more value than stasis.; Immortality over Winter Crown when Use for final Lord fights where a revive is more valuable than surviving one delayed counter-burst.
- Total cost: 11790 gold

Default jungle setup for deleting isolated carries through stacked magic penetration, Starlium follow-up autos, and a safer Ice Retribution chase.

### Jungle Feather Snowball (Jungle)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Feather of Heaven, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Feather of Heaven, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Flame Retribution
- Flex: Starlium Scythe over Blood Wings when Use when you can stay in basic-attack range for the full ring window and want a stronger skill-to-auto burst loop.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use against assassins or suppressive engage that can punish Harley after Space Escape returns.; Glowing Wand over Divine Glaive when Use against shield or sustain lineups before they stack enough Magic Defense to force Divine Glaive.; Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when the first collapse is decided by stuns and slows rather than raw damage checks.
- Total cost: 11790 gold

Snowball jungle setup that trades the earlier Starlium timing for faster basic-attack pressure when Harley is allowed to keep hitting the ringed target.

### Mid Pickoff Flameshot (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Genius Wand, Lightning Truncheon, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Genius Wand, Lightning Truncheon, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flameshot
- Flex: Starlium Scythe over Lightning Truncheon when Use when fights give Harley enough time to weave basic attacks during Deadly Magic instead of landing one poke skill and leaving.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when enemy dive reaches mid lane before Harley can return to the hat.; Glowing Wand over Blood Wings when Use when anti-regen is mandatory and your team already has enough backline burst.; Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use against mid-roam pairs with enough crowd control to interrupt the first pickoff attempt.
- Total cost: 12010 gold

Lane fallback for drafts that need Harley's pickoff burst from mid, using Flameshot to finish targets when the ring leaves them barely alive.

